### Config

## Client configs that should only be copied over once from default configs 
/config/*client.*
/config/emixx/*client.*
/config/worldedit/
/config/emi.css
/config/jade/jade.json
/config/jade/sort-order.json
/config/MouseTweaks.cfg
/config/dynamic_fps.json
## Client config exceptions (Want to be updated)
!/config/defaultsettings/**
!/config/sophisticatedstorage-client.toml
!/config/**/darkmodeeverywhere-client.toml
!/config/create-client.toml
!/config/botania-client.toml
!/config/defaultsettings/Default/options.txt

